            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 13.4 Offsets. The Union agrees that, subject to ongoing Union approval, the Company can offset amounts the Union owes the Company for time charged by employees to Union charge numbers for Union business as detailed in Section 12.1(c) from the monthly dues payments collected by the Company for the Union. The Company will provide a monthly accounting to the Union of all offsets. The parties will agree on guidelines for making such deductions prior to implementing this Section.",
